---
// Separador con el hexágono del logo (una hoja del diafragma) en el centro.
---

<div class="flex items-center gap-4" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-line"></span>
    <svg
        class="h-3 w-3 text-muted"
        viewBox="0 0 200 200"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="12"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
    >
        <polygon points="100,20 140,50 140,150 100,180 60,150 60,50" />
    </svg>
    <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-line"></span>
</div>
